[[9540,3635,"I am concerned that unless staff are trained to call the emergency services immediately, further delays will occur in the administration of potentially lifesaving treatment","delayed emergency response",""],[9541,3635,"I am concerned that when the emergency cord was pulled, the request for assistance want to care staff who were between 1 and 4 minutes away from the restaurant rather than to all staff, some of whom were near by","inadequate staff response",""],[9542,3635,"I am concerned that despite all staff having basic first aid training, evidence was given at the inquest that not all staff are confident using their training","lack of staff confidence",""],[9543,3635,"I am concerned that there is not an advanced first aider on site available to be called upon in an emergency","absence of advanced first aider",""],[9544,3635,"It is my opinion there is a risk that future deaths may occur if these concerns are not addressed","future deaths risk",""]]